    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "This Valentine&#8217;s Day we are sharing the love with you. This show is F R E E to attend, and we have a stellar lineup to share with you.\r\nThis special concert and multimedia extravaganza features live performances, guest appearances, and video exclusives, including Amanda Martinez, Amchok Gompo, Kristine St-Pierre, Leen Hamo, Saskia Tomkins and more!"
